sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant W as Web 前端
    participant A as API 网关
    participant S as 订单服务
    participant P as 支付服务
    participant D as 数据库

    U->>W: 点击「立即购买」
    W->>A: POST /orders
    activate A
    A->>A: JWT 校验
    A->>S: 创建订单
    activate S
    S->>D: INSERT order
    D-->>S: order_id
    S-->>A: 201 Created
    deactivate S

    par 并行处理
        A->>P: 发起支付
        activate P
        P-->>A: 支付链接
        deactivate P
    and 库存扣减
        A->>S: 锁定库存
        S-->>A: ok
    end

    alt 支付成功
        P-->>A: callback success
        A->>S: 更新订单状态
        S->>D: UPDATE status = PAID
        A-->>W: 200 下单成功
    else 支付失败
        P-->>A: callback failed
        A->>S: 回滚订单
        Note over S,D: 释放库存并标记 FAILED
        A-->>W: 402 支付失败
    end
    deactivate A
